! STEOM-DLPNO-CCSD def2-TZVP def2-TZVP/C def2/J RIJCOSX TightSCF NormalPNO
# Memory-trimmed production run: TightPNO def2-TZVP OOM'd building the EOM intermediates
# on 1463 basis functions. Reductions: NormalPNO (was TightPNO), NRoots 5->3 (only the bright
# state matters), NDav 400->200, maxcore 2500. Aim: fit the EOM-prep in 62 GB.
%maxcore 2500
%pal nprocs 8 end
%pointcharges "field_big.pc"
%mdci
  NRoots 3
  DoRootWise true
  DoStoreSTEOM true
  AddL2Term True
  TCutPNOSingles 1e-12
  NDav 200
  MaxIter 200
end
* xyzfile -1 1 geom_big.xyz
